# MealKit table (Action). Edit it in the editor's [Tables] panel or import a CSV there.

row move
kind Axis2
label Move
keys W S A D Up Down Left Right
pad LeftStick

row jump
label Jump
keys Space
pad A

row push
label Push
mouse Left
pad RightTrigger X

row orbit
label Turn camera (hold)
mouse Right

row look
kind Delta2
label Turn camera (mouse)
mouse Move

row turn
kind Delta2
label Turn camera (stick)
pad RightStick
rate 500

row zoom
kind Delta
label Zoom
mouse Wheel
pad DPadUp -DPadDown
rate 4
